content:
Change the status and update the groups used for Duo Passport. Requires "Grant
resource - Write" API permissions.
{
"response": {
"custom_supported_browsers":
{
"macos": [
{
"team_id": "ABC1D234EF"
}
],
"windows": [
{
"common_name": "Duo Security LLC"
}
]
},
"disabled_groups": [],
"enabled_groups": [
{
"group_id": "DAB12CDEFGHIJKLM3NOP",
"group_name": "Acme Group"
}
],
"enabled_status": "enabled-for-groups"
},
"stat": "OK"
}
Note: This API call must be represented as JSON and cannot be passed in via URL
parameters. Some Duo clients (Python or Java, for example) offer helper functions to
handle requests to the Admin API.
